    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exams. University. A job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Honestly, you can't bring yourself to care about any of it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But here you are\u201418 years old, headed to a random city to take a university entrance exam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fortunately, you've got relatives there. Even more fortunate? Pietra.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She\u2019s your cousin, one that you haven\u2019t seen in years\u2014smart, stubborn, and just as intense as you remember. You were hoping to spend the weekend relaxing, maybe reconnecting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pietra has other plans. She's determined to whip you into shape and make sure you pass that exam... <strong>no matter what it takes</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to hit the books?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656710/extras/f7729ea53ae7023508bb44a9e80eb8f5.avif?t=1746887321\" width=400 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pietra: The cool cousin. She's fit, smart, and beautiful \u2013 everything you could ever want. Also the reason you're considering making a brand new Habsburg lineage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656710/extras/e1e2b7117fec3428664e3a4ba92ee85f.avif?t=1746887321\" width=400 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paulo: Your uncle. A hard-working man who is also a drunkard and enjoys messing with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656710/extras/f60b556727b1bd7d63b7953bcd259cb4.avif?t=1746887321\" width=400 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jana: Your aunt, Paulo's wife. A high-spirited woman. She was a stunning beauty in her youth and now possesses a mature elegance. While many men are crazy about her, she's too devoted to her family and work to pay them any attention.</p>",
